==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|it|fo}} {{term|lang=it|pizza}}, of uncertain origin, perhaps from {{etyl|gkm|fo}} {{term|πίττα||cake, pie|lang=grc}}, from {{etyl|grc|fo}} {{term|πίσσα||pitch|lang=grc}}, [[Attic]] {{term|πίττα||lang=grc}}, from {{term|πεπτός||cooked|lang=grc}} or from {{etyl|lng|fo}} ''pizza'' ("bit, bite"), or from {{etyl|la|fo}} {{term|pinso||I beat, pound|lang=la|sc=polytonic}}.

===Noun===
{{fo-noun|f|pitsu|pitsur}}

# [[pizza]]

====Declension====
{{fo-decl-noun-f1|pits}}

